] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">Not sure which program fits your profile? We will help you map the right learning path.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Category 02</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\">Corporate Training</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">Custom AI upskilling programs for engineering teams, built around your stack and workflow.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Category 03</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\">Hiring &amp; Recruitment</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">Access trained AI professionals from our talent pool for direct placement or project hire.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/50\">Category 04</p><p class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\">General Inquiries</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border pt-3\">Admissions, fees, batch schedules, or anything else — we are available every day.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-white dark:bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Ready to <span class=\"brand\">Get Started?</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[14px] text-muted-foreground max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Speak directly with our team or explore the full program catalog to find the right fit.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-foreground text-background text-sm font-semibold hover:opacity-85 transition-opacity\" href=\"https://wa.me/919691440998\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Talk to Our Team</a><a class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border border-border text-foreground text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-muted/40 transition-colors\" href=\"/courses/\">Explore Programs</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 bg-slate-50/60 dark:bg-slate-900/20\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-4\">Location</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Find Us on <span class=\"brand\">Google Maps</span></h2></div><div class=\"w-full h-[450px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"></div></div></section></div></main>"
